### Get all PDF analysis results

GET http://localhost:7071/api/results
Accept: application/json

###

### Get latest 5 PDF analysis results

GET http://localhost:7071/api/results?limit=5
Accept: application/json

###

### Get one PDF analysis result by ID
# Replace REPLACE_WITH_RESULT_ID with an ID returned from /api/results

GET http://localhost:7071/api/results/REPLACE_WITH_RESULT_ID
Accept: application/json